meta {
  name: Replace photo
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/me/photo
  body: multipartForm
  auth: none
}

body:multipart-form {
  photo: @file()
}

docs {
  User login (cookie Authentication_User): run "User auth / Login" first. Approved users only (otherwise 403 user not validated), and only while the request status is 1 or 6, i.e. the user's turn to upload or correct (otherwise 403 "photo can be replaced only at request status 1 or 6"). Replaces the current photo, or creates it if there is none; the old file is deleted best-effort. A JPG or PNG of at most 10 MB: no file is 400 "photo is required", another type is 400 "unsupported file type", over 10 MB is 413.
}
